(6690496, 999497, 56502, '<td valign="top">I''m not too big a fan of this extreme skin processing - otherwise a nice shot.</td>', 'I''m not too big a fan of this extreme skin processing - otherwise a nice shot.', '2012-02-24 10:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6690546, 1000556, 54446, '<td valign="top">Good looking oreos.  I''ll guess you pushed the ISO to get a fast enough shutter speed to capture some of the splash because there''s a distracting amount of noise in the background.  The very narrow DOF does not include enough of the glass and milk particles. Also, the foremost oreo (partially eaten) is in front of the DOF plane.   It really hurts my eyes to view the elements in focus and OOF elements... side-by-side.  What did you want the viewer to see?  The black frame is a big negative.  At the top portion of the image, the frame melts into the black bg.  It reduces the amount of viewable image.   The crop is too tight, with the most interesting part of the splash forced to the top border, where the black frame cuts it off.  The nearly square rectangle voids any harmonious composition attempt to asymmetrically compose the subject.  I do believe you have the white balance done correctly.  I do like oreos.  10</td>', 'Good looking oreos.  I''ll guess you pushed the ISO to get a fast enough shutter speed to capture some of the splash because there''s a distracting amount of noise in the background.  The very narrow DOF does not include enough of the glass and milk particles. Also, the foremost oreo (partially eaten) is in front of the DOF plane.   It really hurts my eyes to view the elements in focus and OOF elements... side-by-side.  What did you want the viewer to see?  The black frame is a big negative.  At the top portion of the image, the frame melts into the black bg.  It reduces the amount of viewable image.   The crop is too tight, with the most interesting part of the splash forced to the top border, where the black frame cuts it off.  The nearly square rectangle voids any harmonious composition attempt to asymmetrically compose the subject.  I do believe you have the white balance done correctly.  I do like oreos.  10', '2012-02-24 10:40:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6690552, 1000621, 54446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fruit tart.  It''s somewhat disturbing to see a recognizable face in the scene.  Bad form.  I''ll just say I have no idea whose face that is.  10</td>', 'Beautiful fruit tart.  It''s somewhat disturbing to see a recognizable face in the scene.  Bad form.  I''ll just say I have no idea whose face that is.  10', '2012-02-24 10:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
