(6691086, 999497, 96751, '<td valign="top">I get the sprinkles as lipstick, but this is a case where over-smoothing has created a rather unnatural and disturbing look around the mouth.</td>', 'I get the sprinkles as lipstick, but this is a case where over-smoothing has created a rather unnatural and disturbing look around the mouth.', '2012-02-24 15:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691087, 1000301, 96751, '<td valign="top">Secret is out now!</td>', 'Secret is out now!', '2012-02-24 15:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691089, 1000607, 96751, '<td valign="top">I know there is a name for these candies, but I can''t think of it.  Nicely arranged, but perhaps a contrasting bg color would have made them pop a bit.</td>', 'I know there is a name for these candies, but I can''t think of it.  Nicely arranged, but perhaps a contrasting bg color would have made them pop a bit.', '2012-02-24 15:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691090, 1000168, 96751, '<td valign="top">THAT would be a nightmare...</td>', 'THAT would be a nightmare...', '2012-02-24 15:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691093, 1000290, 96751, '<td valign="top">I good job of textures and details, although there is something unappetizing about the grayish cast over the image</td>', 'I good job of textures and details, although there is something unappetizing about the grayish cast over the image', '2012-02-24 15:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691097, 1000658, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am DYING here!!!!!  Oh to have a smidgen of your marvelous playfulness!!!  Awesome effect, and incredibly effective.  If this doesn''t win... what I was about to type would have been taken in totally the wrong way :-)</td>', 'I am DYING here!!!!!  Oh to have a smidgen of your marvelous playfulness!!!  Awesome effect, and incredibly effective.  If this doesn''t win... what I was about to type would have been taken in totally the wrong way :-)', '2012-02-24 15:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691099, 1000539, 96751, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cake.  Looks really tiny.  Or is it a chocolate?  Regardless, wouldn''t last long at my house</td>', 'Beautiful cake.  Looks really tiny.  Or is it a chocolate?  Regardless, wouldn''t last long at my house', '2012-02-24 15:53:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691101, 1000506, 96751, '<td valign="top">I was just about to dismiss this without really stopping to look, and something made me stop.  I don''t know why, as the colors are unappetizing. It doesn''t look tasty or flavorful.  And yet, this is an arresting image.  Perhaps the geometry, or the symmetry, or the pov.  But in the end who cares, it''s brilliant.</td>', 'I was just about to dismiss this without really stopping to look, and something made me stop.  I don''t know why, as the colors are unappetizing. It doesn''t look tasty or flavorful.  And yet, this is an arresting image.  Perhaps the geometry, or the symmetry, or the pov.  But in the end who cares, it''s brilliant.', '2012-02-24 15:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691103, 1000401, 96751, '<td valign="top">I was also thinking of making jewelry from candy. It would NOT have turned out this well.  I''ll by the yin/yang and the lime slice ring from you :-)</td>', 'I was also thinking of making jewelry from candy. It would NOT have turned out this well.  I''ll by the yin/yang and the lime slice ring from you :-)', '2012-02-24 15:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691105, 1000501, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Wowowowowow!  How did you do this?  It''s so beautiful!!</td>', 'Wow!  Wowowowowow!  How did you do this?  It''s so beautiful!!', '2012-02-24 15:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691106, 1000507, 96751, '<td valign="top">Gummy bear jacuzzi???  Fabulous colors and light.  The translucence of the bears is breathtaking.</td>', 'Gummy bear jacuzzi???  Fabulous colors and light.  The translucence of the bears is breathtaking.', '2012-02-24 15:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6691107, 1000647, 19825, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... similar to a recent b&amp;w pic with a rawhide bone rather than a Butterfinger. Could this be Geneva again?</td>', 'Hmmm... similar to a recent b&w pic with a rawhide bone rather than a Butterfinger. Could this be Geneva again?', '2012-02-24 15:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
