(6691110, 1000652, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s in those bags, but I''m pretty sure they''re not sweet. Actually, I think it''s body parts...<br/> <br/>Fascinating image, love the light.  But I''m a little grossed out :-)</td>', 'Not sure what''s in those bags, but I''m pretty sure they''re not sweet. Actually, I think it''s body parts... Fascinating image, love the light.  But I''m a little grossed out :-)', '2012-02-24 15:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
