(6691115, 1000621, 96751, '<td valign="top">LOVE inside-the-fridge shots.  This is awesomely done, and an excellent food shot.  Kudos for clarity and keeping the fogging at bay.</td>', 'LOVE inside-the-fridge shots.  This is awesomely done, and an excellent food shot.  Kudos for clarity and keeping the fogging at bay.', '2012-02-24 16:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
