(6691915, 1000501, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very interesting setup. I really like the background swirl but the red M&amp;M does not go well withtge colors in the background at all. Plus the ring of green around it is very off putting. I am assuming it is a picture under glass with a thin layer of water which the M&amp;M is sitting in... One more thing to remember is the tiny details. Your M is sideways.</td>', 'Very interesting setup. I really like the background swirl but the red M&M does not go well withtge colors in the background at all. Plus the ring of green around it is very off putting. I am assuming it is a picture under glass with a thin layer of water which the M&M is sitting in... One more thing to remember is the tiny details. Your M is sideways.', '2012-02-25 20:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
