(6692382, 1000661, 23267, '<td valign="top">I like the warm lighting... several others like this used colder lighting, for me this one has a slight edge.</td>', 'I like the warm lighting... several others like this used colder lighting, for me this one has a slight edge.', '2012-02-26 13:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692384, 1000653, 23267, '<td valign="top">Lots of black here, washes out the main image.  I like the concept.</td>', 'Lots of black here, washes out the main image.  I like the concept.', '2012-02-26 13:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692684, 1000497, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice even lighting, good color and a good reflection on a nice and solid background. I think you could have shot from a bit higher to get more of the color from the icing and sprinkles. As it is, you got good symmetry with the reflection but most of the shot consists of the cake part of the cup cake with is very neutral in color. Also watch your background. I can see the edge of your glass or mirror at the top left. I think you could have cloned that out in advanced!</td>', 'Nice even lighting, good color and a good reflection on a nice and solid background. I think you could have shot from a bit higher to get more of the color from the icing and sprinkles. As it is, you got good symmetry with the reflection but most of the shot consists of the cake part of the cup cake with is very neutral in color. Also watch your background. I can see the edge of your glass or mirror at the top left. I think you could have cloned that out in advanced!', '2012-02-26 20:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6692686, 1000265, 10785, '<td valign="top">I would like a thicker stream of cream. But aside from that the photo has great tones and a good amount of blur to make it more than just a product shot. Love the complimentary colors.</td>', 'I would like a thicker stream of cream. But aside from that the photo has great tones and a good amount of blur to make it more than just a product shot. Love the complimentary colors.', '2012-02-26 20:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
