(6693408, 1000607, 100831, '<td valign="top">Some may think this is just a picture of cute little sweet things but I know they are called allsorts. For me, they are also one of my favorite little sweet things, though I haven''t eaten any in years. I''m actually feeling jealous right now. I guess I have to reward this with score though, for memories sake and because it''s so well done.</td>', 'Some may think this is just a picture of cute little sweet things but I know they are called allsorts. For me, they are also one of my favorite little sweet things, though I haven''t eaten any in years. I''m actually feeling jealous right now. I guess I have to reward this with score though, for memories sake and because it''s so well done.', '2012-02-27 12:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
