(6695289, 1000253, 124190, '<td valign="top">Beautiful quality...lighting....softness.  I rarely criticize and I am already giving you a top score........but   as "they"...IMHO say  this picture would have been perfect with a light muted green candle in a burnished brass candle holder.......geezzz.....you could''a asked...I would have sent you mine!!!! composition is right on....with all the right reflections.   it''s just that bright yellow candle and red ornate holder that make me twitch! (I''m sure my misspelling and bad punctuation make you twitch!)    my daughter''s friend makes confections like those and sells them in Washington D.C.  Beautiful photo!</td>', 'Beautiful quality...lighting....softness.  I rarely criticize and I am already giving you a top score........but   as "they"...IMHO say  this picture would have been perfect with a light muted green candle in a burnished brass candle holder.......geezzz.....you could''a asked...I would have sent you mine!!!! composition is right on....with all the right reflections.   it''s just that bright yellow candle and red ornate holder that make me twitch! (I''m sure my misspelling and bad punctuation make you twitch!)    my daughter''s friend makes confections like those and sells them in Washington D.C.  Beautiful photo!', '2012-02-29 13:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
